of plants.\n\u2705 Interactive mechanics \u2013 Scan, water, and fertilize plants while observing their real-time reactions.\n\u2705 Dynamic environment \u2013 Experience realistic lighting and environmental effects that adapt to different times of the day.\n\u2705 Immersive sound design \u2013 Enjoy high-quality ambient sounds that enhance the atmosphere and realism of the experience.\n\u2705 Relaxing and educational \u2013 Learn fascinating details about plant species while immersing yourself in a peaceful, interactive world.", "short_description": "A Unique VR Botanical Journey\n\nEngage with nature in Green Garden, where every interaction is designed to offer both relaxation and discovery in a beautifully crafted VR greenhouse."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://contenidoecuagenera.github.io/green-garden-privacy/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ecuagenera", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ecuagenera.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8922140294505620"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393516_1366386778138785_8351811791328746934_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HpQf33n